  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Librarius Conclave",
    "summary": "Your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES PSYKER** units share one of these **Psychic Disciplines**, chosen afresh as each battle round begins and kept for that round:\n\n- **Biomancy Discipline:** the unit's Move is 2\" higher.\n- **Divination Discipline:** **Hit rolls** of 1 and **Wound rolls** of 1 may be re-rolled for its attacks.\n- **Pyromancy Discipline:** its ranged attacks get +1 AP, provided the target is an enemy unit no more than 12\" from it.\n- **Telekinesis Discipline:** the Strength of each ranged attack aimed at it is reduced by 1.\n- **Telepathy Discipline:** you may have its attacks disregard any BS, WS or Hit roll modifier.",
